{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：06:58 2026-11-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：06:58 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：06:58 2026-11-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"灣仔辣蟹店凌晨起火傳爆炸聲 消防救熄 疑燃點蚊香惹禍。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/20bfe185a6f023ea3b19aa1858d5ed75/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_21_56_38.jpeg\"/><p>灣仔發生火警。今日（22日）凌晨4時許，警方接獲報案，指謝斐道404至406號地下一間辣蟹店冒煙起火，其間一度傳出爆炸聲。消防接報到場灌救，約38分鐘後將火救熄，經調查後相信火警由燃點蚊香引起，起火原因沒有可疑。事件中無人受傷，毋須疏散。</p><p>現場所見，起火店舖為財記辣蟹，事發時尚未營業。火警後，店舖一幅落地玻璃疑因火警碎裂，玻璃碎片散落地面，消防及警員在場調查，店舖負責人亦返回現場了解。</p><img alt=\"消防調查後，不排除火警由燃點蚊香引起。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/cc36f187a1daeddd0e5c61e707b4a8b4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_21_56_34_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防接報到場後將火救熄。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9f0493cfa68aece0f857fcf784a59833/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_21_56_34.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"店舖負責人返回現場了解。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/41bbe9d55415234ac375fc857f8f176d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_21_56_35.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"店舖一幅落地玻璃在火警中損毀。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4e41d863fdeac2f0d8dea5d436b135d5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_21_56_39.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防認為起火原因無可疑。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/ed16c0c1ee263969502da0d3733c5e2d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_21_56_41.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T00:52:06.663462+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T22:58:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T00:45:40.141977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T00:45:40.141977+00:00","content_hash":"3a03c3e465a6916e0b94fafea37f4eb660f43a7754dc63c40b12be7566c93ffa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}